sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant Handler as Memory Operation Handler
    participant Ledger as Operation Ledger
    participant Driver as Provider Driver
    participant Provider as Memory Provider
    Agent->>Handler: MemoryContextQueryRequest
    Handler->>Ledger: Record request and correlation
    Handler->>Driver: Dispatch envelope
    Driver->>Provider: Query or start async operation
    alt Sync result
        Provider-->>Driver: MemoryContextPack
        Driver-->>Handler: Completed result
    else Async accepted
        Provider-->>Driver: MemoryOperationAccepted
        Driver-->>Handler: Operation accepted
        Handler->>Ledger: Track status
    end
    Handler-->>Agent: Context or operation status
